        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2001-12-27/pdf/01-31959.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of the Board (Board). There is established, effective\nDecember 21, 2001, a Board of three members to be appointed by the\nPresident to investigate and report on this dispute. No member may be\npecuniarily or otherwise interested in any organization of airline employees\nor any air carrier. The Board shall perform its functions subject to the\navailability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2073,
      "char_start": 1957,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13248#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13248#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "66 FR 66705, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "cc092c3770efff6aea51275d84f6924e304b9a30be0fb8706ba36dc612d32469",
        "signing_date": "2001-12-20",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13248.txt",
        "text_sha256": "7f91fc4428e7d0ba22bcd1ccf6a8759c21a403fa3b9a01c8886e9fa83e439170",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2001-12-27/pdf/01-31959.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report. The Board shall report to the President with respect to\nthis dispute within 30 days of its creation."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2409,
      "char_start": 2074,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13248#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13248#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "66 FR 66705, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "cc092c3770efff6aea51275d84f6924e304b9a30be0fb8706ba36dc612d32469",
        "signing_date": "2001-12-20",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13248.txt",
        "text_sha256": "7f91fc4428e7d0ba22bcd1ccf6a8759c21a403fa3b9a01c8886e9fa83e439170",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2001-12-27/pdf/01-31959.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Maintaining Conditions. As provided by section 10 of the Act, from\nthe date of the creation of the Board and for 30 days after the Board\nhas submitted its report to the President, no change in the conditions out\nof which the dispute arose shall be made by the parties to the controversy,\nexcept by the agreement of the parties."
    },
